-  3. **Dispute Penalty ($\gamma_{\text{dispute}}$):** $\gamma_{\text{dispute}} = \max\left(0.0, 1.0 - \frac{2 \cdot n_{\text{neg}}}{n_{\text{pos}} + 1}\right)$.
-  4. **Concave Edge Ceiling ($\Phi_{\text{edge}}$):**
